     Foreground: #059669, Background: #ecfdf5, Ratio: 3.57:1 (NEED 4.5:1)
     Affects: Net Savings dollar figure, projection target/actual lines
     File: web/templates/components/accounts_card.html (from A8 commit 347103c)
     Selector: .text-emerald-600 on .bg-emerald-50 parent
  
  2. /transfers history table amounts (green-600 on white)
     Foreground: #16a34a, Background: #ffffff, Ratio: below 4.5:1
     Affects: positive transfer amounts (e.g., "+$2,000.00")
     File: web/templates/pages/transfers.html line 148
     Selector: .text-green-600 in <td> inside transfer history table

  PRE-EXISTING (UNCHANGED BY THIS RUN but pre-A8 baseline did not use these
  colors, so technically introduced by A8):
  3. Navigation link hover state (white text on light gray)
     Foreground: #ffffff, Background: #f3f4f6 (hover:bg-white/10 on gray-100)
     Ratio: 1.1:1 (NEED 4.5:1)
     Affects: /accounts, /transfers, /dashboard, /explorer nav links
     File: web/templates/pages/base.html (nav links)
