A-9 (Never Color-Only): PASS
  - Low-balance flag: icon + text (in accounts card from A8)
  - Stale account: icon + text
  - Transfer status (Paired/External): icon + text badge
  - Health verdict (Emerald/Amber/Red): label text + color (though text
