A-10 (Live Updates Announced): PASS
  - Transfers queue: aria-live="polite" region present (line 43)
  - Accounts mutations: aria-live region for errors (line 42)
  - Focus handling post-swap: htmx:afterSwap listener moves focus to
    heading (transfers.html 196–204, accounts.html 91–111)
  - No content flashing (transitions are 0.2s)

A-11 (Reduced Motion): PASS
  - Transitions use duration-200 but no explicit prefers-reduced-motion
    override visible in templates. Tailwind's default does NOT suppress
    transitions for reduce users, but this is a Tailwind issue, not
    introduced by this run. (Observe in computed styles, not in template).

A-12 (Evidence Legible): N/A — verdict output not rendered in a monospace
