A-13 (Empty States): PASS
  - Dashboard with no accounts: renders h1, h2 heading structure correctly
  - Transfers with no classified transfers: "No transfers yet" message with h2
  - Explorer with no transactions: gracefully handled

A-14 (Self-Contained/CSP): PASS — no external CDN for Tailwind (inline Tailwind
